comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-06T08:35:18Z","updated_at":"2026-08-15T15:39:03Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n**Reproduced in**\n- 4.7-stable\n- 4.6.2-stable\n\n**Not Reproduced in**\n- 4.7 on Windows 10\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Bazzite 44.20260628.0 (Kinoite) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Single-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 SUPER (nvidia; 610.43.02) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10700KF CPU @ 3.80GHz (16 threads) - 31.23 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n**Edit**: _I'm using a dual screen setup with the main monitor on the right (not sure if relevant but that often led to some issues on Linux)_\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe editor frequently crashes when editing text fields (e.g. search/filter, title/descriptions/accessibility fields for control nodes) while a screen reader is running (Orca, speech dispatcher).\nThe crash does not happen consistently, sometimes it crashes typing into the second field, sometimes the 20th, but when it crashes it seems to always be during a text input (a LineEdit, I believe).\n\nThe crashes do not occur when screen reader is disabled.\nThe editor crash also happens during runtime, when I test the screen reader features in the game, the editor would crash in the background while the game keeps running.\n\n**Error message**\n```\nthread '<unnamed>' (24840) panicked at /home/runner/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/accesskit_unix-0.21.0/src/context.rs:61:78:\ncalled `Result::unwrap()` on an `Err` value: InterfaceNotFound\nnote: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variable to display a backtrace\n```\n\nUnfortunately, I don't know where or how to set that environment variable or I'd provide the backtrace.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- repeatedly type / edit text into any fields\n- the ones I commonly use are:\n - scene hierarchy filter\n - button name and description fields\n - inspector filter field\n - accessibility title and description fields\n - add child node search popup\n\nfor me, the engine crashes within a minute most times when I do this\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[access-kit-crash-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29693850/access-kit-crash-test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120999/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120999/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}